    "body": "I don't really know a lot about ServiceWorkerContainer - and yes, I agree that the spec text could be way clearer. I can tell you that in Blink, we create the promise lazily whenever the ready attribute is read, and in that case, it's whatever execution context the script that reads this attribute runs in.",
